<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Style Mix | Modern Premium Fashion Store</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Shop premium minimalist fashion at Style Mix. Modern clothing designed for everyday elegance.">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">STYLE MIX</div>

        <nav class="nav-links">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#shop">Collection</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="nav-icons">
            <button class="cart-btn" onclick="toggleCart()">
                Cart (<span id="cart-count">0</span>)
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="home" class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>NEW ERA OF MINIMALISM</h1>
            <p>Elevate your everyday wardrobe with our latest premium collection.</p>
            <a href="#shop" class="btn-primary">Explore Collection</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="shop" class="shop-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Trending Now</h2>
        <div class="product-grid" id="product-grid"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="about-section">
        <div class="about-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">About Style Mix</h2>
            <p>
                Style Mix is a modern fashion brand focused on minimalist design,
                premium quality, and timeless style. We create clean and elegant
                pieces designed for everyday confidence and comfort.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact-section">
        <div class="contact-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="contact-text">We would love to hear from you.</p>

            <form class="contact-form">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                <textarea rows="5" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cart-overlay" id="cart-overlay" onclick="toggleCart()"></div>

    <div class="cart-sidebar" id="cart-sidebar">
        <div class="cart-header">
            <h2>Your Cart</h2>
            <button class="close-btn" onclick="toggleCart()">&times;</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cart-items" id="cart-items"></div>

        <div class="cart-footer">
            <div class="cart-total">
                <span>Total:</span>
                <span id="cart-total-price">$0.00</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-primary w-100" onclick="checkout()">Proceed to Checkout</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-grid">
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h3>STYLE MIX</h3>
                <p>Redefining modern luxury.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Customer Care</h4>
                <a href="#">Shipping & Returns</a>
                <a href="#">Size Guide</a>
                <a href="#">Contact Us</a>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Newsletter</h4>
                <div class="newsletter">
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email">
                    <button class="btn-secondary">Subscribe</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; 2024 STYLE MIX. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
    .highlight h3{
      font-size:20px;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }

    .highlight p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:15px;
      line-height:1.9;
    }

    .skills-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap:18px;
    }

    .skill-card{
      background:var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:22px;
      padding:24px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .skill-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-8px);
      border-color:rgba(110,168,255,.35);
    }

    .skill-icon{
      width:64px;
      height:64px;
      margin:0 auto 16px;
      border-radius:18px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-size:24px;
      font-weight:800;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(110,168,255,.18), rgba(143,107,255,.18));
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(110,168,255,.12);
    }

    .skill-card h3{
      margin-bottom:8px;
      font-size:20px;
    }

    .skill-card p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:14px;
      line-height:1.8;
    }

    .services-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
      gap:20px;
    }

    .service-card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:24px;
      padding:26px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .service-card::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      top:-40px;
      right:-40px;
      width:120px;
      height:120px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(110,168,255,.14), transparent 70%);
    }

    .service-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-8px);
    }

    .service-card h3{
      font-size:23px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .service-card p{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.9;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .projects-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
      gap:22px;
    }

    .project-card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:26px;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .project-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-10px);
    }

    .project-cover{
      height:220px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(5,10,18,.20), rgba(5,10,18,.20)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .project-cover.two{
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(5,10,18,.20), rgba(5,10,18,.20)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .project-body{
      padding:24px;
    }

    .project-tag{
      display:inline-block;
      margin-bottom:10px;
      color:#b8d2ff;
      font-size:14px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .project-body h3{
      font-size:28px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .project-body p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:15px;
      line-height:1.9;
      margin-bottom:16px;
    }

    .project-list{
      list-style:none;
      display:grid;
      gap:8px;
      margin-bottom:20px;
    }

    .project-list li{
      color:#dce6fb;
      position:relative;
      padding-left:18px;
      font-size:14px;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .project-list li::before{
      content:"•";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:0;
      color:var(--blue);
    }

    .project-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .contact-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap:18px;
    }

    .contact-card{
      background:var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:22px;
      padding:24px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .contact-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-6px);
    }

    .contact-card h3{
      font-size:21px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .contact-card p,
    .contact-card a{
      color:var(--muted);
      word-break:break-word;
      line-height:1.8;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .cta{
      margin-top:42px;
    }

    .cta-box{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(110,168,255,.14), rgba(143,107,255,.12));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:28px;
      padding:34px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .cta-box h3{
      font-size:32px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .cta-box p{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.9;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      font-size:16px;
    }

    .cta-actions{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .footer{
      padding:30px 0 42px;
      border-top:1px solid var(--border);
      color:var(--muted);
      text-align:center;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .reveal{
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(40px);
      transition:all .8s ease;
    }

    .reveal.active{
      opacity:1;
      transform:translateY(0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px){
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .hero-text{
        text-align:center;
      }

      .hero-text p{
        margin-left:auto;
        margin-right:auto;
      }

      .hero-actions{
        justify-content:center;
      }

      .hero-stats{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px){
      .nav-wrap{
        flex-direction:column;
      }

      .nav-links{
        justify-content:center;
        gap:14px;
      }

      .nav-btn{
        display:none;
      }

      .hero{
        padding-top:40px;
      }

      .hero-image img,
      .profile-fallback{
        height:420px;
      }

      .mini-panel{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .btn{
        width:100%;
        min-width:unset;
      }

      .hero-actions,
      .project-actions,
      .cta-actions{
        flex-direction:column;
      }

      .section{
        padding:75px 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-wrap">
      <div class="logo">Eslam<span>.</span></div>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

      <a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">Hire Me</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text reveal">
        <span class="badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span> Available for freelance & front-end opportunities</span>
        <h1>Hi, I'm <span class="gradient-text">Eslam Mesalam</span></h1>
        <h2>Front-End Developer crafting modern websites with clean design and smooth experience.</h2>
        <p>
          I build responsive, elegant, and professional websites using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
          My goal is to turn ideas into real digital experiences that look premium, feel smooth,
          and help brands stand out online.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Me</a>
          <a href="cv.pdf" download class="btn btn-secondary">Download CV</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat reveal">
            <h3>2+</h3>
            <p>Featured Projects</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat reveal">
            <h3>6+</h3>
            <p>Core Skills</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat reveal">
            <h3>100%</h3>
            <p>Passion & Growth</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card reveal">
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Eslam Mesalam"
               onerror="this.style.display='none'; document.getElementById('fallbackProfile').style.display='flex';">
          <div class="profile-fallback" id="fallbackProfile">
            <div class="fallback-circle">EM</div>
            <h3>Eslam Mesalam</h3>
            <p>ضع الصورة باسم profile.jpg داخل نفس الفولدر</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mini-panel">
          <div class="mini-box">
            <strong>UI Focus</strong>
            <span>Modern clean design</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-box">
            <strong>Responsive</strong>
            <span>Mobile & desktop ready</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-box">
            <strong>Fast Learner</strong>
            <span>Always improving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">About Me</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal">
        A short introduction about who I am and the type of web experiences I enjoy building.
      </p>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <p class="about-text">
            I am a passionate Front-End Developer with a strong interest in building visually attractive,
            responsive, and user-friendly websites. I enjoy turning ideas into modern digital experiences
            through clean layouts, strong typography, and smooth interfaces. I focus on creating websites
            that are not only beautiful, but also practical, fast, and professional. My goal is to keep
            growing through real projects and deliver front-end work that reflects quality and attention to detail.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="highlights">
          <div class="highlight reveal">
            <h3>Clean Design</h3>
            <p>I care about strong layout, elegant spacing, premium sections, and polished visual details.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight reveal">
            <h3>Responsive Experience</h3>
            <p>I build websites that look great and work smoothly across mobile phones, tablets, and desktop screens.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight reveal">
            <h3>Growth Mindset</h3>
            <p>I am constantly learning, practicing, and improving my front-end skills through real projects.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="skills">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">My Skills</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal">
        Technologies and strengths I use to create modern, high-quality user interfaces.
      </p>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-card reveal">
